      "body_text": "Canvas: Day 1, 06:00 (event_test_slice_intro) | Node: Wake\n\n\n\nShe woke before the alarm she had not set. The fan was on. Through the wall, the slow tick of Jake's keyboard. Downstairs, the coffee maker. Somewhere on Route 9 a truck changed gears. The first day of what came next.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSit up.",
      "body_html": "<div class=\"dev-canvas-info\"><strong>Canvas:</strong> Day 1, 06:00 <span style=\"opacity:0.7;\">(event_test_slice_intro)</span> | <strong>Node:</strong> Wake</div><br><p>She woke before the alarm she had not set. The fan was on. Through the wall, the slow tick of Jake's keyboard. Downstairs, the coffee maker. Somewhere on Route 9 a truck changed gears. The first day of what came next.</p><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><a data-passage=\"Location_Maya's_Bedroom\" class=\"link-internal\" tabindex=\"0\">Sit up.</a>",
